      "created_at": "2017-09-29T19:03:49.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Recently I noticed I hadn’t yet unlocked the redirection misdirection achievement.</p>\n<p>Only 5 redirects needed? I’m sure I could do much better than that!</p>\n<p>So off I went with Xtreme Prime Warden Fanatic, Naturalist, The Sentinels, Setback and Tachyon to face off against Baron Blade in the Enclave of the Endlings.</p>\n<p>After a fair bit of setup I ended up with:</p>\n<p>Fanatic hitting Tachyon with Absolution (fire)</p>\n<ul>\n<li>send that to Doctor Medico with Synaptic Interruption</li>\n<li>who is protected by Mainstay’s Human Shield</li>\n<li>The Naturalist’s Indomitable Force takes it from there</li>\n<li>Setback becomes the target from his Uncharmed Life</li>\n<li>back to The Naturalist via his Threatening Stomp</li>\n<li>Setback then put Tachyon in the Wrong Time and Place</li>\n<li>her second Synaptic Interruption sent it swinging towards Baron Blade</li>\n<li>who tried to pick off The Idealist with his Elemental Redistributor</li>\n<li>but she was protected by Bloogo</li>\n<li>who in turn was covered by Immutus</li>\n<li>but Fanatic was focused on killing Tachyon’s spirit</li>\n<li>her final attempt to get away got the last Synaptic Interruption focused on Writhe</li>\n<li>whose Caliginous Form slithered out the way of Baron Blade</li>\n<li>but the sneaky Baron had another Elemental Redistributor and finally the poor Idealist ended up taking the hit</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Phew!<br>\nI make that 14 redirects.</p>\n<p>Anyone else come up with some crazy redirecting shenanigans? Or are we able to get higher than 14?</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:50:13.276Z",
