      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "Recently I noticed I hadn't yet unlocked the redirection misdirection achievement.\r\n\r\nOnly 5 redirects needed? I'm sure I could do much better than that!\r\n\r\nSo off I went with Xtreme Prime Warden Fanatic, Naturalist, The Sentinels, Setback and Tachyon to face off against Baron Blade in the Enclave of the Endlings.\r\n\r\nAfter a fair bit of setup I ended up with:\r\n\r\nFanatic hitting Tachyon with Absolution (fire)\r\n- send that to Doctor Medico with Synaptic Interruption\r\n- who is protected by Mainstay's Human Shield\r\n- The Naturalist's Indomitable Force takes it from there\r\n- Setback becomes the target from his Uncharmed Life\r\n- back to The Naturalist via his Threatening Stomp \r\n- Setback then put Tachyon in the Wrong Time and Place\r\n- her second Synaptic Interruption sent it swinging towards Baron Blade\r\n- who tried to pick off The Idealist with his Elemental Redistributor\r\n- but she was protected by Bloogo\r\n- who in turn was covered by Immutus\r\n- but Fanatic was focused on killing Tachyon's spirit\r\n- her final attempt to get away got the last Synaptic Interruption focused on Writhe\r\n- whose Caliginous Form slithered out the way of Baron Blade\r\n- but the sneaky Baron had another Elemental Redistributor and finally the poor Idealist ended up taking the hit\r\n\r\nPhew! \r\nI make that 14 redirects.\r\n\r\nAnyone else come up with some crazy redirecting shenanigans? Or are we able to get higher than 14?",
